            <div xml:id="m-d67e9f48-3dbd-4b03-a209-1f559ced3ef7">
              <lg xml:id="m-002a9291-3cee-4685-a291-a7a86d797009">
                <l xml:id="m-b65b976e-1a93-45e7-93af-aa9cedaddc25" facs="#m-37ebde5d-5a49-4c62-ad94-32c5baef006c" label="ambiguous">77e</l><l xml:id="m-b8d93ab8-6525-40cd-bc66-1aa9e4efe520" facs="#m-9d3363f7-844a-4db1-887d-7c3f9d0e87ad" label="ambiguous">Holy Saturday</l><l xml:id="m-48fddb4b-ca5f-4e30-9a5d-137d4723c352" facs="#m-ffccd2f4-453b-4f36-bec1-d6e95d3242d6" label="lyrics-like">12. Jústus, ut pálma fiorébit: *sicut cédrus Libani multipli¬</l><l xml:id="m-f784972f-a39c-40ad-b828-5539ace048cc" facs="#m-b2b25960-3fc3-426d-8d8e-b6f12b3d3d6b" label="lyrics-like">cábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-3a445ad6-5679-409d-85df-af96e2a6f9c8" facs="#m-507ee240-89bd-4222-89ce-1ef59e597493" label="lyrics-like">13. Plantáti in dómo Dómini, " in átriis dómus Déi nóstri</l><l xml:id="m-76f14b0e-9da7-4a27-8006-e6751b674a64" facs="#m-f46f2dbf-fde6-4c38-aca2-19a781df5a75" label="lyrics-like">forébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-c77d6cdc-db71-4a4d-8a14-b4435a9ae909" facs="#m-fc9f38e2-d802-4ae7-8409-477d86f22864" label="lyrics-like">14. Adhuc multiplicabúntur in senécta úberi :*et bene patiéntes</l><l xml:id="m-9eaa2722-b784-4ff5-935a-0165fdf08eb7" facs="#m-1d0dd55e-629c-44c9-8161-aeb12017b6b2" label="lyrics-like">érunt, ut annúntient:</l><l xml:id="m-e0e0f22c-0461-4d90-84d3-4ca87c91bcec" facs="#m-00f41352-fcb1-405b-b3a3-c285308ca16e" label="lyrics-like">15. Quóniam réctus Dóminus, Déus nóster :*et non est iniquitas</l><l xml:id="m-96d7e509-b56d-487c-9f5f-e244e25ad23a" facs="#m-cfb7d384-e887-4c57-9b78-196f41cd6714" label="lyrics-like">in éo.</l><l xml:id="m-881ae785-2be5-482d-9a9c-ca5e83e09a7d" facs="#m-785b0d51-57ea-4b65-b061-3bf6294943a8" label="ambiguous">3 Ant.,</l><l xml:id="m-157254dd-8be1-4dca-8f34-88f4dd07321a" facs="#m-f803e8f0-041e-4454-97c6-01532037852e" label="ambiguous">E</l><l xml:id="m-9be21da1-831e-4946-9593-0c10c81e18e1" facs="#m-3483a0ec-17d9-4072-9e4d-cb35c627383f" label="lyrics-like">et vidé- te doló¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae44d844-0335-43cd-839f-8cecc2bebc86" facs="#m-5e106857-4031-4b41-928c-c8d497d15e86" label="lyrics-like">Ttén-di-te“ univérsi pópu-li,</l><l xml:id="m-d3917487-ccd6-480a-bee5-8766e21793fb" facs="#m-7adc2114-fc39-4dae-9ec0-a16f55a7b047" label="lyrics-like">rem mé- um.</l><l xml:id="m-129c16e7-086d-44c4-9f50-a0a2290d03a3" facs="#m-534e09bc-f684-49aa-addd-9f64f67d0d30" label="ambiguous">Psalm e3 (New psalter, p. 63*)</l><l xml:id="m-00e8bbbe-315b-4338-99bd-770e06d10b91" facs="#m-6e8b21c4-1d29-4366-8ac6-87af858c0fa0" label="lyrics-like">1. Exáudi, Dé-us, o-ra-ti-ónem mé-am cum déprecor:"a ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d3b4fec-95a2-4bd5-bbe1-254523871fde" facs="#m-b97fdeae-c4f4-4fe1-bcce-3d94ef845807" label="lyrics-like">mó-re in-imí-ci é-ripe ánimam mé- am.</l><l xml:id="m-ac8f54b0-3220-4bde-af17-54e278744d33" facs="#m-d1c938fb-09e3-4270-822c-068282e09df2" label="lyrics-like">2. Protexisti me a convéntu malignántium: “*a multitúdine</l><l xml:id="m-8bad0921-b480-458a-9faf-df8a076c17af" facs="#m-c6a1f4be-1c27-4a06-8107-c558ab317579" label="lyrics-like">operántium iniquitátem.</l><l xml:id="m-3916091c-5cb4-454b-956d-477579d4f777" facs="#m-52eb9326-3894-4af7-8624-92392f18f1ed" label="lyrics-like">3. Quia exacuérunt ut gládium linguas súas: *intendérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2428672f-dcf6-42fe-a63d-a0e85345dac9" facs="#m-79a0b592-1be9-42bf-bc3b-62197f5344da" label="lyrics-like">árcum rem amáram, ut sagittent in occültis immaculátum.</l><l xml:id="m-43e95710-91a6-4721-8c4e-907967b6c2b9" facs="#m-dc9c132f-9fe6-4508-a32e-34a65626255d" label="lyrics-like">4. Súbito sagittábunt éum, et non timébunt: * firmavérunt</l><l xml:id="m-268cf772-16d9-4997-9354-1b46ef513f5a" facs="#m-b0426633-503b-4963-ace0-a930b7674eba" label="lyrics-like">sibi sermónem néquam.</l><l xml:id="m-97af4414-fd7a-4490-a8a2-63920db0a0a8" facs="#m-803658b8-696f-4cb4-b3f6-957100e7492f" label="lyrics-like">5. Narravérunt ut abscónderent láqueos: * dixérunt: Quis</l><l xml:id="m-e6ed0177-8182-4522-afcd-a6479084f7ef" facs="#m-a0dd094a-6504-401a-aca7-fa24053aa597" label="lyrics-like">vidébit éos?</l><l xml:id="m-80f6d272-fa4f-4ab8-a358-68a77bb2098f" facs="#m-3c8b2797-d689-424f-bb2f-f0f12d99c8fb" label="lyrics-like">6. Scrutáti sunt iniquitátes: * defecérunt scrutántes scrutinio.</l><l xml:id="m-972d5fe8-f706-475e-959c-05d31df0f09a" facs="#m-fe6ba5d7-0d19-4477-8f9e-e7315ffd5d91" label="lyrics-like">7. Accédet hómo ad cor áltum: “et exaltábitur Déus.</l><l xml:id="m-80f75aaf-9191-48b2-8565-21ab9d49e914" facs="#m-5ce4a583-ac3a-4c2d-9826-07a476f760e1" label="lyrics-like">8. Sagittae parvulórum fáctae sunt plágae córum: * et</l><l xml:id="m-4507ba5a-2933-488a-9d45-5481a76fe3e8" facs="#m-433c515e-e4ef-4988-8e4c-bd924939c3d6" label="lyrics-like">infirmátae sunt contra éos linguae eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-1b227e1c-ca22-4f73-af18-fff155754582" facs="#m-68475190-f877-462a-a2a6-0578621eb787" label="lyrics-like">9. Conturbáti sunt ómnes qui vidébant éos: “et timuit</l><l xml:id="m-c85d889c-c20e-4bd9-9f27-08f95e8e7378" facs="#m-2aa33da5-ab30-4816-a14f-8ab22b5b410c" label="lyrics-like">ómnis hómo.</l><l xml:id="m-883e76ef-8eb9-4a45-a36c-11e3eba2b720" facs="#m-7eb1ef36-c452-4a9f-bbce-7871b2edac1a" label="lyrics-like">10. Et annuntiavérunt ópera Déi: * et fácta éjus intelle¬</l><l xml:id="m-355cc3a7-c1a3-4ed9-8cf1-28de4caf6d77" facs="#m-8c6c8638-e2f6-4520-a56b-878902000cb4" label="lyrics-like">xérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-6ac8b921-3fb4-4e1c-97db-39f676301f6e" facs="#m-dc899e1c-5d63-4a96-844c-81c747bf11b4" label="lyrics-like">11. Lactábitur jústus in Dómino, et sperábit in éo, * et lauda¬</l><l xml:id="m-32396ac8-2b77-45ac-a118-87a1001581d7" facs="#m-fb92adda-fb06-4877-89ba-dcaff8929c51" label="lyrics-like">búntur ómnes récti córde.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>